# FinFolio Authentication Configuration
#
# FinFolio uses service account authentication (not API keys) for YouTube Data API v3
# to comply with Constitution Principle VI: Reliability Over Cleverness.
#
# Authentication Method:
# Set the GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS environment variable to point to your
# service account JSON key file:
#
#   export GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=/path/to/service-account-key.json
#
# DO NOT store the service account key in this .env file!
# Service account keys are sensitive credentials. Treat them like passwords.
#
# See docs/SERVICE_ACCOUNT_SETUP.md for detailed setup instructions.
#
# Example (for reference only - DO NOT put the actual key content here):
# GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=/Users/username/.config/finfolio/service-account-key.json
